Article 3 (Submission of Business Plans and Statements of Accounts) The Institute for the Promotion of Filial Piety Culture established under Article 7 of the Act shall submit the following documents to the Minister of Health and Welfare within two months after the end of each business year. <Amended on March 19, 2010>
1. A business plan and budget of revenue and expenditure for the following business year;
2. A business report and statement of accounts for the relevant business year;
3. One copy of the inventory of assets as at the end of the relevant business year.
